[
  {
    "name": "POST /changeSuggestionStatus - 变更建议操作状态(含后置还原,可重复)",
    "description": "单接口测试：POST /changeSuggestionStatus。该接口ES近90天全平台0调用记录。实际Swagger请求体为RuleApplyParam[]，字段为ruleExecutionLogId+action(枚举APPLY_KEYWORD_SUGGESTION/SNOOZE_KEYWORD_SUGGESTION/IGNORE_KEYWORD_SUGGESTION/RESUME_KEYWORD_SUGGESTION)，纠正此前walmart/tiktok同模块case中误用的status:\"accepted\"字段(该字段在真实schema中不存在，猜测该错误字段此前被服务端忽略后直接短路返回成功，掩盖了真实契约)。使用instacart真实执行日志({{variables.real_execution_log_id}})按正确字段调用后，实测返回code:405，服务端SQL报错\"UPDATE rule_execution_detail ... WHERE (rule_definition_id IN () AND query IN (?))\"——rule_definition_id列表为空导致SQL语法错误，属真实后端缺陷(该execution log关联的规则非Adtomic建议类规则，导致规则定义id列表为空，服务端未对空列表做保护)，如实保留FAIL记录该缺陷。两步(IGNORE/RESUME)均因同一缺陷失败，非用例本身编写问题。",
    "module": "history-controller",
    "granularity": "API",
    "since": "init",
    "last_modified": "init",
    "change_type": "NEW",
    "generated_by": "swagger-api-case",
    "steps": [
      {
        "name": "变更建议操作状态为IGNORE",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.RULEBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/changeSuggestionStatus",
        "request_body": [
          {
            "ruleExecutionLogId": "{{variables.real_execution_log_id}}",
            "action": "IGNORE_KEYWORD_SUGGESTION"
          }
        ],
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "data": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "后置还原-变更建议操作状态为RESUME",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.RULEBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/changeSuggestionStatus",
        "request_body": [
          {
            "ruleExecutionLogId": "{{variables.real_execution_log_id}}",
            "action": "RESUME_KEYWORD_SUGGESTION"
          }
        ],
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "data": true
        }
      }
    ]
  },
